    "Holy Fire tick (0%). Live, rank 8 Holy Fire (15261) is snapshotted once it lands; Exorcism then lands about",
    "1.6 s later, so the remaining time must exceed the snapshot by at least 1000 ms. Without the fix it only shrinks."
